{"title":"关于开展广东省项目管理协会标志征集活动的通知","date":"2024-02-22","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 33pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n16.0pt;font-family:方正小标宋简体;mso-hansi-font-family:方正小标宋简体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n方正小标宋简体\">关于开展广东省项目管理协会标志征集活动的通知</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:\r\n16.0pt;font-family:方正小标宋简体;mso-hansi-font-family:方正小标宋简体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n方正小标宋简体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:33.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">为提升广东省项目管理协会（英文名称：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">Guangdong Project Management Association</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">）公众形象和影响力，规范协会对外交流宣传标识，更好地为行业和会员服务，现向社会公开征集广东省项目管理协会标志（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">LOGO</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">）设计方案。具体要求如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">一、征集时间</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">即日起至</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">15</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">日。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">二、设计要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">设计作品需充分展现项目管理行业特性，富有美感并具有较强的视觉冲击力。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">作品采用彩色图形设计，图案整体简明大方，清晰流畅，构图主旨鲜明，创意独特，寓意贴切，易于辨识。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">设计作品必须是原创作品，此前未以任何形式发表，杜绝抄袭、雷同，严禁侵犯他人的著作权、商标权等知识产权，不得违反国家法律法规。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">标志需提交矢量文件和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">JPG</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">两种格式，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">JPG</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">格式不得小于</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">100x100mm</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">且需</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">300dpi</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">以上，同时附设计理念说明或内涵注释（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">300</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">字以内），应征者可同时提交多套设计方案。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">三、投稿要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">作品以电子邮件投稿，可发送至广东省项目管理协会秘书处邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">gpma@vip.163.com</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">。请在电子邮件主题注明</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&ldquo;LOGO</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">征集</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">现场投稿可邮寄至：广东省广州市天河区华强路</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">9</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">号保利中盈大厦</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">25</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">层</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">2509</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">室；收件人：罗小姐，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">19988261397</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">投稿时同时提交《广东省项目管理协会标志设计信息表》（附件）。信息表中需注明单位名称或个人真实姓名、主创者身份证号码、手机号码、通讯地址等信息。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">若是单位参选，请提供单位营业执照。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">四、评选方式</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">广东省项目管理协会秉承客观、公正的原则组织专家对征集的标识设计方案进行评选，在征集作品中确定</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">10</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">件入围，并确定</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">件（或</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">件为主体，综合其它入围作品的部分元素）录用为广东省项目管理协会标志。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">五、奖励设置</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">入围作品的作者将获得一定奖励，奖励金均以人民币形式支付，奖励金为含税金额。获奖作者若为单位的，需由参选单位提供正规等额增值税发票后支付。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">录用其作品，作为广东省项目管理协会标志使用的，给予</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">3000</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">元奖励和证书，其余</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">9</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">件入围作品的作者（或单位）分别给予</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">500</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">元奖金和证书。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\">六、其他说明</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:黑体;mso-bidi-font-family:黑体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">对于入围的应征作品，著作权、使用权等相关权利全部归主办单位所有，主办单位享有对作品进行修改和深化设计的权利。应征者不再享有与该作品著作权有关的任何权利。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">如果出现创意相同或类似的应征作品，则以收件时间来确定第一创意者。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">应征作品恕不退还，请作者自留底稿。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">入围的应征作品因抄袭等侵权行为造成的一切后果由应征者承担。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n仿宋_GB2312\">5.</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">其他未尽事宜由主办单位负责解释。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（联系人：罗小姐，联系电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">19988261397</span><span style=\"text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">）</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\">附件：</font></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><font face=\"仿宋_GB2312\"><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202402/%EF%BC%88%E7%B2%A4%E9%A1%B9%E7%AE%A1%E5%8D%8F%E3%80%942024%E3%80%951%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%89%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%B1%95%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E7%9C%81%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%8D%8F%E4%BC%9A%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E5%BE%81%E9%9B%86%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.pdf\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">1、通知原件</span></a></font></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202402/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8.docx\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; text-indent: 32pt;\">2、信息表</span></span></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>"}